==Danish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|da}} {{term|í gær|lang=non}}, {{term|í gjár||yesterday|lang=non}} (whence Icelandic {{term|í gær|lang=is}} and Faroese {{term|í gjár|lang=fo}}).

